    "%1$@ · %2$@": {
      "comment": "Two things in a row: a backup’s account count (%1$@) and transaction count (%2$@), a budget’s repeat (%1$@) and its days left (%2$@), or, below 0 available, a budget’s “₹0.00 spent” (%1$@) and “−₹500.00 available” (%2$@).",
